{"story_id":96033,"updated_at":"2026-11-26T00:57:08","headline_en":"Delhi Police arrest three people for gang-rape of woman at cafe","headline_hi":"दिल्ली पुलिस ने ईस्ट दिल्ली के एक कैफे में एक महिला के सामूहिक बलात्कार के मामले में तीन लोगों को गिरफ्तार किया","payload_en":{"story_id":96033,"headline":"Delhi Police arrest three people for gang-rape of woman at cafe","counts":{"articles":7,"independent_sources":6,"outlets":7},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"interim","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Brut","Free Press Kashmir","India Today","NDTV","NDTV India","News18","The Hindu"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":72622,"parents":[{"story_id":72622,"headline":"Canacona rape: police arrest Bihar native for assaulting four-year-old girl"}],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-11-26T00:57:08","category":{"v":2,"primary":["india"],"secondary":["justice"],"tertiary":["crime","probes"]},"places":["delhi"],"people":["Preet Vihar","East Delhi","Delhi Police","Sultanate Cafe","(East) Rajeev Kumar","Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita","Mandawali","unnamed source"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"Delhi Police arrested three people in connection with a gang-rape complaint in Preet Vihar, East Delhi, yesterday.","ids":[169344],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2,3,4,5]}],[{"text":"On Monday, the group consumed alcohol at a cafe and then at a colleague's residence in Mandawali before returning to the cafe (Saltanate Cafe) in Preet Vihar.","ids":[169373],"class":"single","sources":[4]}],[{"text":"A 22-year-old woman attended a party with her colleagues at Sultanate Cafe in Preet Vihar on Monday night.","ids":[169363],"class":"single","sources":[6]},{"text":"The group allegedly left at around 3:30 am.","ids":[169358],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"The woman lodged a police complaint at 5:45 am.","ids":[169359],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"The group reopened the venue with a spare key after the cafe closed and continued until early morning.","ids":